# porto-features (this package)

**Docs:** `docs/vocabulary.md` · `docs/scenario-policy.md` · `docs/matrix.md` · **PR review:** [`.cursor/BUGBOT.md`](../BUGBOT.md) · **Doctrine:** [features-layering-doctrine.mdc](features-layering-doctrine.mdc)

Published paths only: `porto_features/errors.json`, `porto_features/features/`, `porto_features/fixtures/`. Coverage indexes belong in Lab `labs/matrix/`.

| Intent | Tag / phrase |
|--------|----------------|
| Free catalog | `@sdk` |
| Paid purchase | `@adapters` + `@canary` or `@heavy`; `When I create a mark` |
| Failure contract | `@error` + unique `@scenario:` + `PORTO_*` in `errors.json` |
| Offline resolve | `When I resolve the letter` in `resolution.feature` — never fake `simulation: true` |

Do not add `mark_simulate`, `stamp_generation`, or CLI `stamp simulate`. Do not use `@full` / `@release` (use `@heavy`).
